    cml:operator "Prohibit" ;
    cml:logicSummary "Prohibits forced labour." ;
    cml:premiseText "(2) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person conducts any business; and  (b) the business involves the forced labour of another person (or persons)." ;
    cml:conclusionText "The business involving forced labour is prohibited." ;
